  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wWM3IZQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"1219\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>《遺物化暮光森林》是「遺物模組(Relics)」與「暮光森林模組(Twilight Forest)」之間的兼容擴展，為暮光森林維度添加了數個獨特主題的遺物。目前，此擴展新增了7種新遺物，可通過擊敗暮光森林中的頭目獲得。這些遺物將賦予玩家其原主人所擁有的部分能力。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5xsiBjv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"613\" height=\"100\"></p><p>必要依賴模組：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遺物模組 (RELICS)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮光森林 (TWILIGHT FOREST)</a></li>\n</ul><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/l1Kt0vx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.1版本：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-twilight-forest/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmbtbFi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p><p><strong>問：我可以在模組包中使用這個模組嗎？</strong><br>答：可以，歡迎隨意收錄。</p><p><strong>問：我可以將此模組轉發到其他資源站嗎？</strong><br>答：不行，禁止轉載。</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V2jX1pa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1186617%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1186617%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dReliquified%2bTwilight%2bForest%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想試試我們的其他模組嗎？ - 前往 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 查看更多資訊！</strong></p>\n</div>",
